      "writtenOn": "2018-02-02T18:17:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can\u0027t you just compute directly?\n\ntarget_code \u003d target * -2/3;\n\nOr if you want to round:\n\ntarget_code \u003d -(target * 4 + 3) / 6;\n\nIf it\u0027s important to hit the target to within some close threshold, then you can check afterwards.  If a small error is acceptable:\n\nif (fabs(target - target_code * -1.5) \u003e 0.1)",
      "range": {
